 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Try keeping the ground clear of brush and rocks, and tent every night. Bugs hate open space. Some people swear by them, but they only last for several hours, and you still need a bug net on top. Lemon juice and vinegar are great for dressing, but they don't stop bites. It' the soap and hot water that beat the bees. Smart. Fill it while you' at it, and leave it with everyone. People forget where they put their cups, but they never forget where they leave their water bottle.",
